# Official workflows

The official system-tests workflows are:

- `.github/workflows/system-tests.yml`
- `utils/ci/gitlab/main.yml`
- all other files that may be called by the above

## Job tagging

All jobs executed by these workflows in caller repositories (repositories other than system-tests) **MUST** tag themselves with `_ci_framework:system-tests`.

`_ci_framework` is a private tag (leading underscore). It will be used for a test period (October 2026).
